| **크기** | | 6.54-6.86 cm (2.57-2.70 inches) | 6.54-6.86 cm (2.57-2.70 inches) | 7.00-7.30 cm (2.76-2.87 inches) | 6.54-6.86 cm (2.57-2.70 inches) |
