INSERT INTO tennis_rules (source_file, rule_id, content, embedding) VALUES ('테니스규정집(2020.11.20 개정판).pdf', '3. 선수 소개', '**3. 선수 소개**
a. 체어 엄파이어가 선수를 소개할 경우 “Two minutes”라고 한 후 다음
과
같이 말한다.

*   “This is a _____ round singles/doubles match, best of three/five
tie-break sets. To the left of the chair _____, and to the right of the
chair ______. _____ won the toss and chose/elected to _____.”
*   “This is a _____ round doubles match. This match will consist of
two tie-break sets with No-Ad scoring. At one set all, a ten-point
match tie-break will be played to decide the match.”

b. 다른 아나운서가 선수를 소개할 경우 웜업 중 다음과 같이 말한다.

